## Model card

- **Claimed name:** Mercury Edit 2 (folder slug `mercury-edit-2`, id `inception/mercury-edit-2`).
- **Finding:** Inception Labs' diffusion-based next-edit prediction model for code autocomplete and multi-line edits, aligned with Kahneman-Tversky Optimization (KTO). Served via FIM (`v1/fim/completions`) and next-edit (`v1/edit/completions`) endpoints at $0.25/$0.75 per 1M ($0.025 cached), 32K context, 8,192 max output. Official Inception docs describe capabilities and pricing only; no standardized benchmark scorecards (SWE-bench, Terminal-Bench, Artificial Analysis, LiveCodeBench) published for this exact edit-specialized checkpoint in this pass.
- **Context window / modalities / pricing:** verified from official Inception docs (32,000 total; 8,192 max output; text in, text out; $0.25/$0.75 per 1M, cached $0.025/1M).

